 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve> 
 CNSsolve>@RUN:begin/iteration.cns(iteration=$iteration;) 
 ASSFIL: file iteration.cns opened.
 CNSsolve>module ( iteration ) 
 &_2_ITERATION set to $_1_ITERATION 
